  - id: album_childroom_bedroom
    text: Finally, my own room!
  - id: album_childroom_darkstar
    text: Looks good to me, time to go play!
  - id: album_studioapt_bedroom
    text: Classes start Monday! Uni, here I come!
  - id: album_studioapt_bathroom
    text: Private bathroom! Score!
  - id: album_studioapt_kitchenette
    text: I have to cook for myself? Uh oh.
  - id: album_studioapt_darkstar
    text: Eh, I'll tidy up a bit later.
  - id: album_sharehouse_livingroom
    text: Movie nights are gonna be awesome!
  - id: album_sharehouse_bathroom
    text: Wait, we're all sharing one bathroom?
  - id: album_sharehouse_bedroom
    text: This was a big day! I'm ready for bed.
  - id: album_sharehouse_kitchen
    text: WAY bigger than my last kitchen!
  - id: album_sharehouse_diningroom
    text: Game nights just got more convenient!
  - id: album_sharehouse_darkstar
    text: They knew me at uni, they knew what to expect.
  - id: album_boyfriendapt_livingroom
    text: Feels so serious moving into his place!
  - id: album_boyfriendapt_kitchen
    text: Not all coffee is instant, who knew?
  - id: album_boyfriendapt_bathroom
    text: A shower with a view!
  - id: album_boyfriendapt_bedroom
    text: Barely managed to fit myself in here!
  - id: album_boyfriendapt_darkstar
    text: It's fine, he likes my spontaneity!
  - id: album_parenthouse_bedroom
    text: This room used to feel bigger.
  - id: album_parenthouse_bathroom
    text: My sister and I used to fight over this bathroom.
  - id: album_parenthouse_darkstar
    text: Took a while to get it all back to how I left it.
  - id: album_soloapt_livingroom
    text: I'll figure out where to get a couch from later.
  - id: album_soloapt_bathroom
    text: I've missed long baths!
  - id: album_soloapt_bedroom
    text: A queen sized bed all to myself!
  - id: album_soloapt_office
    text: Making this my art space!
  - id: album_soloapt_kitchen
    text: Glad I found a place this nice on my budget!
  - id: album_soloapt_darkstar
    text: Wasn't planning to entertain much anyway.
  - id: album_partnerapt_livingroom
    text: So much more cozy now! Feels like a home.
  - id: album_partnerapt_bathroom
    text: All those drawers filled up quickly!
  - id: album_partnerapt_bedroom
    text: So glad for all that wardrobe space now!
  - id: album_partnerapt_office
    text: It's been hard but I'm starting to get somewhere!
  - id: album_partnerapt_kitchen
    text: Looking forward to fresh culinary adventures!
  - id: album_partnerapt_darkstar
    text: Welcome to the jungle!
  - id: album_house_foyer
    text: Our new home!
  - id: album_house_bathroom
    text: A family-sized bathroom!
  - id: album_house_nursery
    text: We're so looking forward to meeting you!
  - id: album_house_closet
    text: Enough space for all our clothes and then some!
  - id: album_house_bedroom
    text: Looking forward to the first sleep in our new house!
  - id: album_house_office
    text: My professional space, for me, the professional!
  - id: album_house_toilet
    text: Bonus toilet!
  - id: album_house_kitchen
    text: Finally, a fridge big enough for all our magnets!
  - id: album_house_diningroom
    text: We're already planning the dinner parties!
  - id: album_house_livingroom
    text: Lots of space and a backyard! We can get a pet now!
  - id: album_house_darkstar
    text: Looks good to me, time for a nap!
  - id: album_credits
    text: Thanks for joining me on this journey.
  - id: album_credits_darkstar
    text: Not going back inside the house, it's trashed.
