  - id: lyrics_1_1
    text: The moving truck pulls up
  - id: lyrics_1_2
    text: there's a knock on the door
  - id: lyrics_1_3
    text: Now all your stuff is here
  - id: lyrics_1_4
    text: in boxes on the floor
  - id: lyrics_2_1
    text: You open up a box
  - id: lyrics_2_2
    text: there is so much to do
  - id: lyrics_2_3
    text: I open up my heart
  - id: lyrics_2_4
    text: this is now a home for two
  - id: lyrics_3_1
    text: Your house plant brightens up
  - id: lyrics_3_2
    text: the dreary windowsill
  - id: lyrics_3_3
    text: Your blanket keeps us warm
  - id: lyrics_3_4
    text: in the evening chill
  - id: lyrics_4_1
    text: We pull your favourite mug
  - id: lyrics_4_2
    text: out of the packing foam
  - id: lyrics_4_3
    text: Stick magnets on the fridge
  - id: lyrics_4_4
    text: and we make this house a home
  - id: lyrics_5_1
    text: You put our photo on the shelf
  - id: lyrics_5_2
    text: I smile to myself
  - id: lyrics_6_1
    text: You cut the tape with my stanley knife
  - id: lyrics_6_2
    text: and we unpack your life
  - id: lyrics_6_3
    text: We unpack your life
  - id: lyrics_7_1
    text: Slowly, slowly, our things combine
  - id: lyrics_7_2
    text: Your favourite stuffed toy right next to mine
